{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2022-11-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'INTUIT AND SUH FAMILY FOUNDATION LAUNCH NATIONAL FINANCIAL LITERACY PROGRAM FOR HIGH SCHOOL STUDENTS', 'text': "MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--INTUIT (NASDAQ: INTU), THE GLOBAL FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM THAT MAKES TURBOTAX, CREDIT KARMA, QUICKBOOKS, AND MAILCHIMP, TOGETHER WITH THE SUH FAMILY FOUNDATION, CO-FOUNDED BY NDAMUKONG AND KATYA SUH, TODAY ANNOUNCED A PARTNERSHIP TO BRING FINANCIAL LITERACY EDUCATION TO HIGH SCHOOL STUDENTS IN SOME OF THE NATION'S LARGEST SCHOOL DISTRICTS IN DALLAS, LOS ANGELES, AND OAKLAND."}